# Build output / scratch
_probe/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.blend1
tools/probe_run_prefs.txt
*_install.zip
MaterialBakery-*.zip
*-v[0-9]*.zip

# Third-party binaries are never vendored here: QuadRemesher is a commercial
# product of Exoside and is not distributed with this repository. The rule is
# kept as a guard for anyone who drops a local copy in for packaging.
#
# NOTE: this used to be silent-broken. A PowerShell rewrite of this file merged
# the rule into the comment line above it, so git never read it and 105 vendor
# files were committed by `git add -A`. Verifying an ignore rule means running
# `git check-ignore -v <path>`, not grepping this file for the path.
MaterialBakery/QuadRemesher/

# Secrets: never commit a token.
*.token
.gh-token*
*Token*.txt
*token*.txt
